{
"markdown": "### Mikkyy\n\n**Modern, lightweight theme engine for iOS 16 - 26.** Bring icon themes to modern iOS releases.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
{
"class": "DepictionScreenshotsView",
"screenshots": [
{
"url": "https://m4fn3.github.io/repo/web/depictions/images/Mikkyy_preview1.jpg",
"accessibilityText": "A themed Home Screen with custom icons, widgets, live Calendar and Clock icons, and Dock icons"
},
{
"url": "https://m4fn3.github.io/repo/web/depictions/images/Mikkyy_preview2.jpg",
"accessibilityText": "Themed app icons displayed in the Share Sheet, with themed Settings icons behind it"
}
],
"itemCornerRadius": 12,
"itemSize": "{185,400}"
},
{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Icon Theming:** Themes app icons on the Home Screen, Dock, App Switcher, Share Sheet, Settings, and folder previews.\n- **Live Icons:** Preserves themed live Calendar dates and Clock faces and hands.\n- **Legacy Theme Support:** Uses existing WinterBoard and SnowBoard `.theme` packages with no conversion.\n- **Easy Management:** Includes a master switch, installed-theme picker, and quick access to the theme folder.\n- **Free:** Available for free.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
{
"markdown": "### Want more than icons?\n\n**Mikkyy Pro** themes the rest of the interface as well: Settings rows, Control Center, the status bar, and artwork inside apps. It also adds icon masks, custom corner radius, and icon size.\n\nCurrently for iOS 16 and 17. [See what Pro adds](https://m4fn3.github.io/repo/web/MikkyyPro.html)",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
